{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53860","headline":"柳栢赋附谣 · 李德裕","name":"柳栢赋附谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚山侧兮秋（一作「湘」）水源，美斯栢兮托幽根，条总翠兮冬转茂，实垂昧兮秋始蕃，彼变化兮不测焉，知非张绪之精魂。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一四五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}